---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms — Green Nest Co"
  description="Terms of use for the Green Nest Co website — a curated affiliate platform for natural-living homeware."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <hr class="eyebrow-rule" />
      <span class="kicker">The small print</span>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="lede">Plain terms for a plainly-run platform.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="doc">
        <h2>About this site</h2>
        <p>
          Green Nest Co (“GNc”, “we”, “us”) is a curated affiliate platform. We showcase and
          recommend homeware from third-party partner brands and link to their websites. We do not
          sell, stock, ship, or handle returns for any product shown here.
        </p>
        <h2>Purchases from partners</h2>
        <p>
          Any purchase you make takes place on a partner brand’s own website, under their terms,
          pricing, availability and returns policy. GNc is not a party to that transaction and is
          not responsible for the products, service, or fulfilment of partner brands.
        </p>
        <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
        <p>
          Some links on this site are affiliate links. GNc may earn a commission on qualifying
          purchases at no extra cost to you. See our
          <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.
        </p>
        <h2>Content & accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          We write our own descriptions and take care to keep information accurate, but details,
          prices and availability are set by partner brands and can change. We make no warranty
          that content is complete or current.
        </p>
        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          GNc’s name, wordmark, original copy and site design are ours. Partner brand names and
          imagery remain the property of their respective owners.
        </p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@greennestco.co.uk">hello@greennestco.co.uk</a>.</p>
        <p class="muted">Last updated: 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
